{
  "name": "Tactical Strikes",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You learn the following new ways to use your Sneak Attack:</p><ul><li><strong>Confound (Cost: 1d6).</strong> The target must make a Wisdom Saving Throw or have Disadvantage on Attack Rolls against you until the start of your next turn while any of your allies are within reach of its attacks.</li><li><strong>Instigate (Cost: 3d6).</strong> An ally of your choice within 60 feet of you can use its Reaction to make a weapon attack against the same target, provided it is within reach.</li></ul>",
